    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Easy to learn, hard to master. Overcome your limits in this tight precision platformer with  quick respawns. Jump from walls, avoid deadly traps and time your movements perfectly so you can climb out of the deep cave you fell into. It\u2019s all about not giving up!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/0039871799d6df05fa6c9d01691f0276.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/0039871799d6df05fa6c9d01691f0276.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/0039871799d6df05fa6c9d01691f0276.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can\u2019t really answer how you got here. You\u2019re very deep in this cave and can\u2019t find anyone else. All that\u2019s left is to face the challenge alone.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/e0c300d17577be863c1a49b6a5528540.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/e0c300d17577be863c1a49b6a5528540.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/e0c300d17577be863c1a49b6a5528540.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It seems like the cave doesn't want you to leave. It tries to hold you, and everything hurts, making you return to the beginning.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/fd378197461610c9b99607f0790db66e.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/fd378197461610c9b99607f0790db66e.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/fd378197461610c9b99607f0790db66e.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>But you must keep trying. Every failure is a lesson. After each fall, you rise up better.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/91d6b0fbd0a1207654e83f2019c13764.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/91d6b0fbd0a1207654e83f2019c13764.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/91d6b0fbd0a1207654e83f2019c13764.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Even if the challenge seems too harsh, you can do it.<br>After all, you are never really alone.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Features:<li>Over 50 levels<br></li><li>Quick respawn<br></li><li>Precise movement<br></li><li>Full controller support<br></li><li>Assist mode<br></li><li>Play it fullscreen or windowed!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Easy to learn, hard to master. Overcome your limits in this tight precision platformer with  quick respawns. Jump from walls, avoid deadly traps and time your movements perfectly so you can climb out of the deep cave you fell into. It\u2019s all about not giving up!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/0039871799d6df05fa6c9d01691f0276.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/0039871799d6df05fa6c9d01691f0276.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/0039871799d6df05fa6c9d01691f0276.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can\u2019t really answer how you got here. You\u2019re very deep in this cave and can\u2019t find anyone else. All that\u2019s left is to face the challenge alone.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/e0c300d17577be863c1a49b6a5528540.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/e0c300d17577be863c1a49b6a5528540.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/e0c300d17577be863c1a49b6a5528540.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It seems like the cave doesn't want you to leave. It tries to hold you, and everything hurts, making you return to the beginning.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/fd378197461610c9b99607f0790db66e.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/fd378197461610c9b99607f0790db66e.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/fd378197461610c9b99607f0790db66e.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>But you must keep trying. Every failure is a lesson. After each fall, you rise up better.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/91d6b0fbd0a1207654e83f2019c13764.poster.avif?t=1638450886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/91d6b0fbd0a1207654e83f2019c13764.webm?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744460/extras/91d6b0fbd0a1207654e83f2019c13764.mp4?t=1638450886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Even if the challenge seems too harsh, you can do it.<br>After all, you are never really alone.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Features:<li>Over 50 levels<br></li><li>Quick respawn<br></li><li>Precise movement<br></li><li>Full controller support<br></li><li>Assist mode<br></li><li>Play it fullscreen or windowed!</li></ul>",
